Package: libpve-storage-nonraid-perl
Architecture: all
Depends: ${perl:Depends}, ${misc:Depends},
 libpve-storage-perl (>= 9.0~),
 nonraid-tools (>= 1.23~),
 mergerfs
Recommends: nonraid-dkms
Description: NonRAID storage plugin for Proxmox VE
 Exposes a NonRAID array as Proxmox VE directory-backed storage: on
 activation the plugin starts the array via nmdctl, mounts the member
 disks and unions them into a mergerfs pool. Includes an optional web
 UI integration that adds a NonRAID entry to the Add Storage menu.
